    {
      "id": "claim_3785d85927c64e5985603aba0abd2c30",
      "statement": "For Slack, _dispatch_or_queue_slack_run selects multitask_strategy='interrupt' when the message explicitly tagged the bot and 'enqueue' otherwise, so an untagged reply lands behind the current run while an explicit request preempts it.",
