      "statement": "Queued payloads are rebuilt into structured <input-message> envelopes via build_input_messages with attribution: queue messages use the system:thread-queue identity, dashboard payloads carrying a sender become human messages attributed to that person on the web surface, and a dashboard-source marker becomes a dashboard-handoff system message.",
